{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The microSD cards with adapters fit my repeated purchases of memory cards and a card reader; they serve a familiar need for removable storage.",
    "The portable Samsung SSD could help organize camera files, so it feels relevant even though a memory card is my first choice this visit."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The internal SATA drives require a computer upgrade need I do not currently have; sharing a storage purpose does not make them interchangeable with memory cards.",
    "The iPad case does not fit my known Fire 7 tablet, while the earbuds, tracker pack, and streaming stick do not address a current need."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My repeated memory card purchases seem to have been interpreted as interest in any kind of storage device.",
    "My purchases of assorted electronics seem to have been stretched into interest in unrelated devices and accessories for equipment I have not shown I own."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Compatibility matters: my previous cards were 16GB or 32GB, so I would need to verify support before choosing a 256GB or 512GB microSDXC card.",
    "I repeatedly buy practical accessories for specific equipment, such as tripods, cables, card holders, and a lens cap; usefulness with my existing setup matters more than a broad electronics connection."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in removable storage but stretched it too far into computer upgrades and devices without a clear use in my current setup."
}"}
